---
import Layout from "@layouts/Layout.astro";
import CenteredHero from "@components/CenteredHero.astro";
import SimpleBlock from "@components/SimpleBlock.astro";
import heroImage from "@assets/heroes/malue-home-hero.png";
---

<Layout>
  <CenteredHero
    titleHtml="Helping healthcare <span class='highlight'>adopt</span> what works"
    description="Malue is building an incentivised decision intelligence platform for healthcare and regulated sectors. Designed to help organisations capture frontline experience, structure evidence and support the adoption of better ways of working."
    primaryText="Partner With Us"
    primaryHref="/partner"
    secondaryText="Learn More"
    secondaryHref="/about"
    imageAlt="Illustration of growth and collaboration"
    imageSrc={heroImage}
  />

  <SimpleBlock titleHtml="From promising idea to measurable improvement">
    <p>
      Malue helps healthcare teams explore, test and adopt changes that improve
      services. Our work has supported major equipment procurement, real-time
      professional engagement, sustainable clinical alternatives and new
      workforce models.
    </p>
    <p>
      Each collaboration addresses a practical partner need while strengthening
      a reusable improvement capability, bringing together stakeholder insight,
      evidence, governance, implementation planning and impact measurement in
      one place.
    </p>
  </SimpleBlock>

  <SimpleBlock titleHtml="The <span class='highlight'>Malue</span> loop">
    <p>
      A connected platform loop that moves improvement from insight through to
      measurable, adopted value.
    </p>
    <p>LOOP GRAPHIC HERE</p>
    <p>
      The answers to many healthcare operational challenges already exist within
      the system. Clinicians see what fits workflow. Procurement teams
      understand decision risk. Patients experience the consequences of service
      design. Industry partners see where products can help. Operational leaders
      understand the pressure on cost, capacity and performance.
    </p>
  </SimpleBlock>

  <SimpleBlock titleHtml="How we work">
    <p>
      Malue works alongside healthcare organisations, departments and teams to
      turn promising ideas into evidence-led, adoptable improvements.
    </p>
    <p>
      Each initiative helps our partners address an immediate challenge while
      also strengthening the reusable tools, workflows and insights available
      through the Malue platform. This means practical work in areas such as
      engagement, implementation, sustainability and service redesign
      contributes to a broader capability for managing change, from
      understanding the problem through to adoption and impact measurement.
    </p>
  </SimpleBlock>
</Layout>
